<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Hello&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span><font face="arial">{!Contact.FirstName},</font></p><p class="MsoNormal"><font face="arial"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal">Thank you for working hard to organize your upcoming blood drive.<b>
</b>Your blood drive plays an important role during this time to ensure there
are no delays in medical treatment for patients in need.</p><p class="MsoNormal"><br></p><p class="MsoNormal">A blood donation is a gift that can give comfort and bring cheer to patients in need this holiday season.</p><p class="MsoNormal"><br></p><p class="MsoNormal">When donors come to give blood Dec. 16 - Jan. 3, 2025, they'll receive a NEW long sleeved Red Cross T-shirt, while they last.*</p>

<p class="MsoPlainText"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal">As you continue the work to make your drive a success –
remember to use these tips:<o:p></o:p></p>

<ul style="margin-top:0in" type="disc">
 <li class="MsoNormal"><b>Share
     the attached email</b> about this exciting incentive to
     recruit more blood donors!<o:p></o:p></li>
 <li class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left:0in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1"><b>Fill
     your schedule.</b> Use these tools to recruit blood donors and schedule
     them using the <a href="https://www.redcrossblood.org/mydrives.html/home">Blood
     Drive Management Portal.</a><o:p></o:p></li>
 <li class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left:0in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1"><b>Encourage
     donors to schedule a donation for a friend.</b> Each additional donor
     scheduled means more lives saved!</li></ul><p class="MsoNormal">If you have any questions, please do not hesitate to reach
out – I’m always here to help!</p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">All the best, <o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">{Account Manager Name}</span><o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0.25in; background: white;"><br></p>]]></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" height="50" >
<td tEditID="c1r3" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r3" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 16.8pt; line-height: normal; background: white;"><font color="#323130" face="Segoe UI, Segoe UI Web (West European), -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, Helvetica Neue, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 10px;">*Subject to change. Offers applicable to presenting donors only during the dates above and while supplies last. T-shirt sizes are limited. Offers subject to availability of donation opportunities in presenting donor’s area. No substitutions and not transferable by presenting donor. Not redeemable for cash.</span></font></p>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>